{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 7.2 Key Takeaways\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Let's summarize the most important concepts you've learned.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b IMX708 Camera Node:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Uses rpicam-vid subprocess as bridge\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Parses MJPEG stream using JPEG markers\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Decodes with cv2.imdecode()\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Converts to ROS with cv_bridge\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Publishes to /camera/image_raw\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b ToF Camera Node:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Uses ArducamDepthCamera SDK directly\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Requires device index 8 (not 0)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Needs I2C permissions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Converts depth to 3D point cloud\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Publishes /point_cloud and /depth_frame\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b ROS 2 Fundamentals:}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nodes are modular, single-purpose programs\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Topics enable pub/sub communication\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Timer callbacks handle periodic tasks\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab cv_bridge translates OpenCV \u8596 ? ROS\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Parameters make nodes configurable\sa180\par}
